bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.beta5 _(ONLY ON STEAMDECK! I tried it on a regular linux machine and a windows machine and couldn't reproduce the issue, it only reproduces on the steamdeck.)_\n- Not reproducible in 4.4.1stable\n\n(There was another bug before beta 4 that prevented the steamdeck controller being used at all so it isn't possible to test earlier beta versions of 4.5)\n\n### System information\n\nSteamOS(Linux)/SteamDeck. Godot 4.5beta5\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn the SteamDeck in 4.5beta5 using the analog stick to navigate a 2d UI skips buttons, sometimes multiple buttons at a time. The problem doesn't happen when using the d-pad. The problem also happens with external controllers connected to the Steamdeck (I used a Xbox One controller when testing).\n\nSee the problem in the video below:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f11e9e8-300d-469b-af63-5a814b64f735\n\nThis is a video of the same project but exported with 4.4.1 stable, the problem doesn't occur and the navigation happens one button at a time:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af329913-f1da-48b0-a1a6-45cbd7dac8c5\n\nI tested it with a regular linux machine and the problem doesn't happen. I also tested it in a windows machine and the problem doesn't happen. I believe the problem only happens specifically in the SteamDeck for some reason. But didn't happen before with 4.4.1stable\n\nI believe it's a regression that came with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106218\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExport the project as a linux x86_64 build, open it on the steamdeck (in regular steam mode), and try to use the analog stick to navigate through a UI menu. It is reproduced with both the steamdeck's own analog sticks or external controllers analog stick (I tested with an XBox One controller as well).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere is the MRP project I used in the video:\n[SteamdeckControllerMRP_.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21692450/SteamdeckControllerMRP_.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https:/